  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Lattupalli Sanjeeva Reddy vs The State on 23 September, 2020 Author: M.Satyanarayana Murthy Bench: M.Satyanarayana Murthy v f v t --_ ~ ~~ *~ yt In The High Court Of Andhra Pradesh At Amaravati Wednesday, The Twenty Third Day Of September Two Thousand And Twenty : Present: The Honourable Sri Justice M.Satyanarayana Murthy Criminal Petition No: 3902 Of 2020 Between: 1. Lattupalli Sanjeeva Reddy, S/o. Rami Reddy, Age about 45 years, R/o No.1-27- Jaspal, Kv Rangareddy District, Telengana State. (A3) 2. Shaik Abdul Khaleed, S/o. Abdul Khaled, Age about 43 years, R/o Dr. No. 17-1- 120, Edi Bazar, R.C. Nagar, Charminar, Yakutpura, Hyderabad, Telangana. (A7) Petitioner/Accused No.3 and 7 And",
    "facts": "2. It is the case of the prosecution that on 25.02.2020, the petitioners along with other accused were found in illegal transportation of Gutka, Khaini and also 1500 gms of Ganja and the contraband was seized from their possession. 3.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that the products which are being transported will not fall under the definition of food as per Section 3(j) of FSS Act.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that the products which are being transported will not fall under the definition of food as per Section 3(j) of FSS Act.",
